&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;By Rizzykun&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Category: OSINT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our agents managed to locate one of the suspects. We lost contact before he could tell us where he was. This snapshot was the only documentation he could send. Can you find where this place is?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: Use the google map name if you have found the location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flag format: SIBER25{main_street-town_name-state_name-country}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Answer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resource:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-01.png"
width="683"
height="822"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-01_hu_c9a92e20d74b35ec.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-01.png 683w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Screenshot 1"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="83"
data-flex-basis="199px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, this is the last place the suspect was seen, okay , Let’s lock in!!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First, we need to identify where is this place, maybe the shops could help?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-02.png"
width="1252"
height="872"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-02_hu_f64a1b040a156117.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-02_hu_3e1a1166eeb5fb5c.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-02.png 1252w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Screenshot 2"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="143"
data-flex-basis="344px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, he is near these shops. Let’s try locating every single store.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When googling each of the store names, almost every single one returns that it is a part of multiple branches of a store chain in Russia except for Клубника, салон фотопечати (Strawberry, Photo Printing Salon). This store is an independent and unique store, then, I find a city website named chaykovsky which holds info about the store.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-03.png"
width="1490"
height="940"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-03_hu_3c9fc7a21245c261.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-03_hu_8d7f3fe655ada918.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-03.png 1490w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Screenshot 3"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="158"
data-flex-basis="380px"
&gt;
 &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-04.png"
width="1531"
height="688"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-04_hu_b32109e01463b566.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-04_hu_c1c26591fc8e6e93.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-04.png 1531w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Screenshot 4"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="222"
data-flex-basis="534px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The website pinpoint the exact location of the store and give the address. Then, I enter the address in google Maps and it gave the result:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-05.png"
width="1452"
height="854"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-05_hu_12bd23c4edd2b138.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-05_hu_9235c4e4d556c9df.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/siber-siaga-2025-finale/img-05.png 1452w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Screenshot 5"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="170"
data-flex-basis="408px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then, we get the address , following the flag format we got : &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SIBER25{ulitsa_sovetskaya-chaykovsky-perm_krai-russia}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The suspect was last seen located near mall named ТЦ (Мега).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>SUN CTF 2025: Who's Alpha</title><link>https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Aug 2025 09:14:47 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/1.jpg" alt="Featured image of post SUN CTF 2025: Who's Alpha" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chall details&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Field&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Details&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Author&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;warlocksmurf &amp;amp; Sai&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;OSINT&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Score&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;260&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;One of the largest financial institutions in Malaysia, &lt;strong&gt;MoneyPro Sdn Bhd&lt;/strong&gt;, has been breached by a notorious hacker group led by a mysterious figure known only as “Alpha.” As part of the &lt;strong&gt;Malaysia Cyber Defend Associate (MCDA)&lt;/strong&gt; team, your mission is to uncover Alpha’s true identity. Flag format: &lt;code&gt;sunctf25{Firstname_LastName}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interestingly this chall only had 4 out of 81 teams that were able to solve it in time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The challenge shipped with an incident report on the MoneyPro breach: &lt;a class="link" href="investigation-report.pdf" &gt;Investigation Report (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id="-solution"&gt;&lt;a href="#-solution" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;🕵️‍♂️ Solution
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/Rizzykun/rizzykun.github.io/blob/master/content/post/2025/sunctf/osint/InvesigationReport.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Investigation Report&lt;/a&gt; given,
The only lead we have is the social media account of a user named &lt;strong&gt;Bravo&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s where the OSINT trail begins..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/1.jpg"
width="794"
height="717"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/1_hu_793e0eafeb50a87.jpg 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/1.jpg 794w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image1"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="110"
data-flex-basis="265px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="tracking-bravos-social-media"&gt;&lt;a href="#tracking-bravos-social-media" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Tracking Bravo’s Social Media
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I searched through popular social platforms and eventually located Bravo’s &lt;strong&gt;X (Twitter)&lt;/strong&gt; account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/2.png"
width="1124"
height="871"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/2_hu_1f382a9bbb463aaf.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/2_hu_92157f728a7c4ff2.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/2.png 1124w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image2"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="129"
data-flex-basis="309px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scrolling through his timeline revealed an interesting clue—a suspicious &lt;strong&gt;Google Drive link&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/3.png"
width="1220"
height="686"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/3_hu_bf80bfbcfb99afc4.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/3_hu_93fde82254107e46.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/3.png 1220w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image3"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="177"
data-flex-basis="426px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="exploring-the-google-drive"&gt;&lt;a href="#exploring-the-google-drive" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Exploring the Google Drive
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Drive contained:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A folder full of &lt;strong&gt;logos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A file named &lt;code&gt;Private.zip&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;code&gt;Note.txt&lt;/code&gt; file&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/4.png"
width="1172"
height="163"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/4_hu_74eeaaa9a3f97654.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/4_hu_83cf90fbbb5deda2.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/4.png 1172w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image4"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="719"
data-flex-basis="1725px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opening the note revealed a &lt;strong&gt;password hint&lt;/strong&gt;: it was a combination of Bravo’s mother’s name and an important day (the day he signed a &lt;strong&gt;RM10,000 contract&lt;/strong&gt;). Both details can be found in his X posts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="unlocking-the-zip"&gt;&lt;a href="#unlocking-the-zip" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Unlocking the Zip
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/5.png"
width="661"
height="188"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/5_hu_247964f2db27f9a9.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/5.png 661w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image5"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="351"
data-flex-basis="843px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With the password reconstructed, I unzipped &lt;code&gt;Private.zip&lt;/code&gt; to find intelligence on the &lt;strong&gt;TigerP4tch&lt;/strong&gt; group. Inside Bravo’s folder, I finally uncovered a partial name:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lucas M.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hunt for his last name was on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="following-charlies-trail"&gt;&lt;a href="#following-charlies-trail" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Following Charlie’s Trail
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inside Charlie’s folder, a chat log between Bravo and Charlie revealed another breadcrumb. Bravo hinted that something important was stored on &lt;strong&gt;Pastebin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/6.png"
width="1440"
height="3200"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/6_hu_d5eb90a78808bb1.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/6_hu_c9f22be7608af493.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/6.png 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image6"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="45"
data-flex-basis="108px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="pastebin-recon"&gt;&lt;a href="#pastebin-recon" class="header-anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Pastebin Recon
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;After some digging, I located a Pastebin account under the username &lt;code&gt;Alice_R&lt;/code&gt;. However, the paste was &lt;strong&gt;password-protected&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/7.png"
width="1264"
height="388"
srcset="https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/7_hu_e1af687b82eb60ea.png 480w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/7_hu_884b9cec9a305959.png 1024w, https://rizzykun.github.io/p/osint-whos-alpha/7.png 1264w" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 800px, 100vw"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
alt="Image7"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="325"
data-flex-basis="781px"
&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
